<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Oksen from Tjoflot — Tjoflot upper parking–Oksen summit return</name><desc>Start at the established upper parking reached by the gravel road from Tjoflot. Climb the steep forest path to Vindhovd, continue along the open ridge and rougher upper mountain to Oksen at 1,241 metres, then return along the same path.

